  "statement": "Let \\(f(n)=\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{k^{n} \\cdot k!}\\). Calculate \\(\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty} f(n)\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
